== Upgrades ==
=== Personal Bests ===
'''Personal Bests''' are a purchasable perk within '''Anita'''{{'}}s shop. Once purchased, the amount of [[Crops]] collected during [[Jacob's Farming Contest]]s by the player will be tallied, and based on their high score, they will receive an appropriate {{Stat|crop fortune}} increase. The value is capped at {{stat|Crop Fortune|100|icononly=yes}}.
