== Tips ==
*For maximising the '''Personal Best''' perk, players can spawn {{Green|8}} [[Pests]] of the respective crop and [[Vacuum]] them at the start of the [[Jacob's Farming Contest|Farming Contest]], as well as plant the crops in [[Greenhouse]] and harvest them during the event. Using this, it's simple to reach the highest required personal best and beyond.

